  "Id": "e58d1c9a-4b26-4f83-a071-c2d95b3f68e4"/*SampleGltfAnimation*/,
  "Description": "Samples an animation clip of a loaded glTF scene into a pose with one point per joint.\n\nConnect the setup of a [LoadGltfScene] with an animated model and feed the pose into [PoseToSkinMatrices]. Without a connection to OverrideTime, the clip follows the playback time. A connected OverrideTime is interpreted in seconds.",
